@ApiGateway.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5013

### Log in as the demo admin
POST {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Log in as the demo customer
POST {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "customer",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

### List orders (proxied to Order Service)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### List products (proxied to Inventory Service)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###
